mportant;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='padding-left: 1.2em;width: 577.647px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);list-style-type: circle;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            巴西 达特拉 Aramosa，天然低因，甜感有点小不一样，风味很柑橘\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            巴西 达特拉 尖身波旁， 我还没怎么喝，这个是masterpiece系列，就冲这个稀缺度也赶紧冲一把吧，因为就那么一小箱生豆，订阅发一些后也没多少了\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            云南\n           </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='padding-left: 1.2em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);list-style-type: circle;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            蔓飞龙 超级日晒  稳！最近的越发的细腻了\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            佐园 铁皮卡 厌氧日晒 ， 2022晚脱壳批次，细腻细腻plus\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            佐园 可娜 水洗 浅焙，深焙，特别要推一下深焙，这个如果你去跟蓝山深焙pk，我觉得毫无压力\n            <br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            佐园 瑰夏 ，强推！！！也是越来越好喝，厌氧日晒批次越来越稳定出彩了，水洗和蜜处理新产季已经到库，准备上新中\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: left;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n              意式\n             </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            春季拼配 每年的春季拼配好像都挺受欢迎的，一年之计在于春, 好像有点道理\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            Honey B， 最近有收到反馈风味不足，重新调整了组成比例，再次上路，大家来品品~~\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            CREAM DB， 这个调整了组成，加多了埃塞的比例有一阵子了，终于有人喜欢它了，嘿嘿~感觉会是一个新的深焙主打款\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            SOE Bench maji水洗，这个是2023新产季，当前使用的还是空运回来的一袋，海运也已经到位，库存充足，现在豆子状态很好，烘焙老大说要给它搞一个手冲和意式都可以用的烘焙度，于是现在在售的是手冲意式都可以用的，后面手冲如果单独调整会单独上新一个单品品相，当前是当SOE在卖的\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n            其他的也都好喝的~有不好的也请毫无顾虑的反馈给俺们客服\n           </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7S442Zcicg5icyJfWdgeT4ltv6ItgPmibmTscVCnH3Bew61cWm2ibZeyYre3XPYcpedkY2jibFRrGyIa9Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 220px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
